To {!Contact.FirstName},

Your loan with {!advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c} has recently charged off due to non-payment and has been sent to us, the legal department for review. The amount due on the loan is {!advpm__Matter__c.Total_Amount_Charged_Off__c}. We understand that your business may be struggling and therefore wanted to reach out to see if you were interested in working out a payment plan without having to proceed with possible litigation.

Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss further.

Sincerely,

{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Name__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC
